格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"this is a plugin about dsh","id":"gh:1338298282","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-msg-rewind","slug":"flow2dream/dsh-msg-rewind","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"this is a plugin about dsh"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-msg-rewind"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Conversation rewind commands for DeepSeek Harness web."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- `/undo` — roll the chat back one full turn (drop the last real user message and everything after i"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"t)\n- `/rewind` — pick a past user message from a dialog and cut the conversation back to it\n- **Visu"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"al rewind** — hover a user message bubble in the chat and click the ⤺ undo button to rewind to that "},{"id":"p5s4","text":"wind** — hover a user message bubble in the chat and click the ⤺ undo button to rewind to that point"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Both the model context **and** the visible transcript are truncated, and the durable JSONL artifact "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"is rewritten so the cut survives a restart."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"*Real screenshots from dsh web.*"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Capability | Detail |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| `/undo` | Reverts the previous turn: deletes the last real user message and all events after it |\n"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"| `/rewind` (bare) | Opens a dialog listing every user message (chronological, most recent preselect"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ed); pick one to rewind there |\n| `/rewind <seq>` | Directly rewinds to the given message seq |\n| Vi"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"sual rewind | Hover any user bubble → click the undo icon (shown with time + copy) to rewind to that"},{"id":"p11s5","text":" message |\n| Durable | Rewrites the session's JSONL+zstd artifact; the cut survives a restart |\n| Cl"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"ean UI | No \"command completed\" noise cards after a rewind |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness web (dsh web)\n- Node `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0`"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Via npm (recommended)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Then restart the web profile:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Via GitHub"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Then restart the web profile:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Manual"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Add the dependency and bundle to your web profile:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Then install and restart the web profile:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"In any conversation:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- Type `/undo` — the chat rolls back one turn.\n- Type `/rewind` — a dialog opens with every user mes"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"sage; the most recent one is preselected. Arrow keys navigate, Enter rewinds.\n- Hover a **user** mes"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"sage bubble — a small undo icon appears next to the copy button; click it to rewind to that message."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The rewind target is the real user message (system injections such as runtime-context and skill-cata"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"log snapshots are never treated as user turns)."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- **Host** (`lib/index.js`) registers the `/undo` and `/rewind` commands. A rewind drains the persis"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"tence coordinator, splices the live session log, resets every derived cache, rewrites the JSONL arti"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"fact, resets the agent's request-header anchor, and broadcasts `session/rewind`.\n- **Browser** (`lib"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"/client.js`) listens for `session/rewind`, resyncs the target session's window from the host, and in"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"jects the hover undo button into user bubbles.\n- The `session/rewind` event is allowlisted in `dsh-a"},{"id":"p33s6","text":"pi-remotes`'s forwarded events."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Source lives in `lib/`:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- `lib/index.js` — host half (commands + truncation)\n- `lib/client.js` — browser half (resync + visu"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"ex.js` — host half (commands + truncation)\n- `lib/client.js` — browser half (resync + visual rewind)"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
